Did the board actually build, and does its layout keep its own predictions?

{{ ref('board').output | tojson(indent=2) }}

Fail if any of these hold:
- ato_build is not "pass", or any assertion failed
- the chosen placement fails a layout rule it predicted would pass, without an
  open_issue explaining it
- fewer than three placements were tried
- drc.errors is not 0
Reply with only valid JSON: {"results": "pass"} or {"results": "fail"}.
